      "paperId": "76f35a0a0ae224728f322dc58190e10751805669",
      "title": "Verso of the \u201cVulgar\u201d Portrait: Georgi Plekhanov\u2019s Anti-Kantianism and Activist Aesthetic",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "David Sockol",
          "authorId": "114716839"
