      "paperId": "56350b044259b75f9058f99ccfa80b29d39d7af4",
      "title": "Plekhanov as \u201cDefender\u201d of Kant from Neo-Kantians",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "T. Rumyantseva",
          "authorId": "2363770651"
